==Battleground==
*5 [[Snache]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 8~13.33 seconds<sup>240f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The only threats are the Wild Doges, who are outranged by almost all units. Spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]], [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba Cats]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] to take care of them, while using [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to handle the Mooths.

